MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Day 3 (Lan Hạ, "Las balsas") now runs answer -> specific teaching
feedback -> confirmed takeaway -> souvenir -> Atlas -> week close ->
next-day recall, inside the existing ask/take structure (step IDs unchanged).

- Shared: optional DayConfig.teach (authored templates) and
  teachingReply(): the first template whose references her answer
  fills. Never for a skip, state answer, hidden step or empty answer;
  never reaches into another day.
- API: a step with a teaching line stores it with generated: false and
  makes no model call. Completion and completedAt are unchanged.
- Mobile: the day screen shows the same line offline; DoneScreen and
  the Atlas landmark sheet carry a SouvenirStamp (tap to collect,
  idempotent, reduced-motion aware). Keepsakes are kept on the phone
  (keepsakesCollected) and cleared on account reset.
- Week close: a kept line the day taught on outranks a plain kept line,
  so the confirmed takeaway reaches "What shifted".
- Copy (ES + EN, DRAFT for review): Day 3 eyebrow, teaching lines,
  "por confirmar" prefill; Day 4 recalls the current Day 3 note.
- Seed regenerated; content parity OK.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
